  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support and Interventions towards Mitigating the Impact of Cassava Brown Streak and Mosaic Diseases in Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase cassava yields from 5 tons/ha to at least 15 tons/ha in affected target areas
To empower farmers and extension staff with knowledge and information on the identification and control of CBSD and CMD
To identify cassava varieties with dual resistance to infection of CBSD and CMD</narrative>
  </description>
